      "writtenOn": "2018-12-05T02:51:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Right, but the value is left over from a previous match in that case\n\nIsn\u0027t that what we want? We didn\u0027t actually perform a call to fp_finger_match in this case, so the timing from the last time we did perform a match should still be valid?\n\nIt does seem ambiguous to me since the error case updates the timestamp and marks it invalid, so I\u0027ll defer to your preference.",
      "parentUuid": "d84a7fde_ee2f21cb",
      "revId": "8b5d3f5b75d693e5cb0a16631629bf50704c0474",
